  "description": "\"Soohyun’s not your average college student, considering his unfortunate circumstances. He’s always had bad luck, but even he didn’t expect to be sold off to and locked up at a secret, exclusive sex club where he’s used mercilessly by the clients against his will… It hasn’t always been like this for Soohyun. There was a time, long ago, when he was in love with a boy who was gentle and kind and loved by everyone… But little does Soohyun know, his past and present aren’t as separate as he thinks. When he runs into someone familiar at the club, all those memories are going to resurface in a whirlwind and riptide of emotions, and his past and present are going to come together… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
